1
00:00:00,153 --> 00:00:06,760
Part 24 mein backup aur security: encrypted backup, Google Drive connection,

2
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:14,323
backup history, test restore, recovery kit, data export, two-step sign-in, audit trail,

3
00:00:14,323 --> 00:00:16,757
aur data ka maalik kaun hai.

4
00:00:17,704 --> 00:00:20,873
System mein Backup and restore kholiye.

5
00:00:20,873 --> 00:00:26,968
Yeh screen is project ki QA ke dauraan Distribution ke menu mein jodi gayi.

6
00:00:26,968 --> 00:00:31,681
Pehle distributor ko backup ki koi screen nahi dikhti thi,

7
00:00:31,681 --> 00:00:34,932
jabki backup system sabke liye same hai.

8
00:00:35,591 --> 00:00:44,309
Backup AES-256-GCM se encrypted hota hai, aur use sirf aapki recovery kit ki key khol sakti hai.

9
00:00:44,309 --> 00:00:48,577
Recovery kit sign-up ke samay download hui thi.

10
00:00:48,577 --> 00:00:53,299
Yahan key ka fingerprint dikhta hai, poori key nahi.

11
00:00:53,966 --> 00:01:00,703
Google Drive connection: Medoro ke hosted server par backup aapke apne Google Drive mein

12
00:01:00,703 --> 00:01:01,468
jaata hai.

13
00:01:01,468 --> 00:01:06,291
Is demo server par asli Google ki jagah ek test Drive judi hai.

14
00:01:06,291 --> 00:01:11,650
Asli Google account se judne ke liye Connect Google Drive dabate hain.

15
00:01:12,317 --> 00:01:14,015
Backup now dabaiye.

16
00:01:14,015 --> 00:01:18,036
Poore business ka encrypted backup banta hai,

17
00:01:18,036 --> 00:01:26,347
jisme distribution ke saare tables shamil hain: products, batches, orders, invoices, ledgers.

18
00:01:26,347 --> 00:01:31,441
History mein samay, size, checksum aur status dikhta hai.

19
00:01:32,132 --> 00:01:38,102
Test restore backup ko ek alag test copy mein kholta hai aur jaanchta hai,

20
00:01:38,102 --> 00:01:40,039
live data ko chhue bina.

21
00:01:40,039 --> 00:01:46,816
Asli restore owner hi kar sakta hai, business code type karke, taaki galti se na ho.

22
00:01:47,567 --> 00:01:53,017
Data export ke liye har MIS report CSV mein, GST returns JSON mein,

23
00:01:53,017 --> 00:01:57,817
aur chemist aur supplier statements nikaale jaa sakte hain.

24
00:01:57,817 --> 00:02:04,243
Data aapka hai: plan band karne par bhi exports aur backups uplabdh rehte hain.

25
00:02:04,936 --> 00:02:11,917
Security ki baaki parten: owner aur manager ke liye two-step sign-in, staff ke liye PIN,

26
00:02:11,917 --> 00:02:17,549
har role ki seemit permissions, aur badla na ja sakne wala audit trail.

27
00:02:17,549 --> 00:02:21,516
Session ek samay ke baad apne-aap khatam hota hai.

28
00:02:22,204 --> 00:02:26,360
Hosting ke vikalp: Medoro ke cloud par shuru kariye,

29
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:29,957
ya apne server ya apne database par chalaiye.

30
00:02:29,957 --> 00:02:35,712
Settings mein yeh line saaf likhi hai ki aapke records kahan rehte hain.

31
00:02:36,377 --> 00:02:40,990
Yaad rakhiye: recovery kit kabhi online share mat kariye,

32
00:02:40,990 --> 00:02:44,227
use print karke surakshit jagah rakhiye.

33
00:02:44,227 --> 00:02:49,812
Password, recovery codes aur authenticator kabhi kisi ko mat bataiye,

34
00:02:49,812 --> 00:02:51,997
Medoro support ko bhi nahi.
